AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000344> "'has effect on' is a special case of the 'is about' relationship to be used for mixed effect models"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000344> "AGB: this relationship requires more discussion in light of potentially adding the Effect class as per the issue: https://github.com/ISA-tools/stato/issues/75

Thus the definition is temporary.

The domain and range were 'variable' but removing now to discuss the specific restrictions when the issue is discussed.

Not extracting to separate ontology (stato-experimental.owl) due to IDs already assigned. If deemed not necessary in the future, the IDs should be deprecated."@en)
