AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000265> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000265> "A factor level is data item which corresponds to one of the value assumed by a factor or independent variable manipulated and set by the experimentalist. In the context of factorial design, a factor level is assumed to be or treated as a category in a categorical variable"@en)
